  (text "SUPPLIES: ME6211 LDO +5V -> +3V3 (MCU, ADC, CAN logic). USB VBUS diode-ORed into +5V via D4 for bench flashing.\nU3 TPS7B6950: short-proof sensor 5V (+5V_SENS, 150mA, 40V in) from protected VBAT. VBAT and +5V come from the Power page."
    (at 25.4 30.48 0)
    (effects (font (size 2 2) (bold yes)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid "7f210358-dfd7-4484-b599-85bdece31733")
  )
